5,1,1,talk,Mio,,I hate doing math before turning on the lights. Let's fix this so we can just live.,"{""words"":17,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
6,1,1,talk,Ryuji,,I need to see the actual numbers before we agree to anything. I am not guessing.,"{""words"":16,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
7,1,1,talk,Rin,,Who is going to do the paperwork? I don't want it to be me every month.,"{""words"":16,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
8,1,1,talk,Shunichi,,The old split is broken. We need to know who is actually using what.,"{""words"":14,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
9,1,1,talk,Misaki,,I just want us to stop avoiding each other over money. It’s getting weird.,"{""words"":14,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
10,1,2,talk,Mio,,"@Ryuji, if we don't look at the data, how do we know what's fair?","{""words"":14,""mentions"":[""Ryuji""],""raw_differs"":false}"
11,1,2,talk,Ryuji,,"@Mio, exactly. I want to see the history. I want to see the costs.","{""words"":14,""mentions"":[""Mio""],""raw_differs"":false}"
12,1,2,talk,Rin,,"@Shunichi, if we meter everything, does that mean I have to log it?","{""words"":13,""mentions"":[""Shunichi""],""raw_differs"":false}"
13,1,2,talk,Shunichi,,"@Rin, someone has to. I want to see the usage patterns.","{""words"":11,""mentions"":[""Rin""],""raw_differs"":false}"
14,1,2,talk,Misaki,,I want to see how the last few months went. The tension is real.,"{""words"":14,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
15,1,3,talk,Mio,,I’m worried about the cold. I want to know what the heating costs.,"{""words"":13,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
16,1,3,talk,Ryuji,,I will look at the statements. I will also look at the payment log.,"{""words"":14,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
17,1,3,talk,Rin,,I’ll check the template. I want to see how much work it is.,"{""words"":13,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
18,1,3,talk,Shunichi,,I’ll look at the monitor readings. I want to see the real usage.,"{""words"":13,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
19,1,3,talk,Misaki,,I’ll look at the kitchen notice. I want to see what people are avoiding.,"{""words"":14,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
20,1,4,talk,Mio,,Okay. Let’s see what we find. I hope it’s simple.,"{""words"":10,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
21,1,4,talk,Ryuji,,It won’t be simple. But it will be clear.,"{""words"":9,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
22,1,4,talk,Rin,,As long as it doesn’t take all my evenings.,"{""words"":9,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
23,1,4,talk,Shunichi,,Clarity is better than guessing. Let’s proceed.,"{""words"":7,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
24,1,4,talk,Misaki,,Agreed. Let’s look at the facts.,"{""words"":6,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
