35,2,1,talk,Mio,,"The rooms are so different. Two need heat from November, the others stay warm.","{""words"":14,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
36,2,1,talk,Ryuji,,"The bills swing wildly. February was 29,400, August was 9,100. No two months are close.","{""words"":15,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
37,2,1,talk,Rin,,The template is a nightmare. Keying in every invoice takes forever.,"{""words"":11,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
38,2,1,talk,Shunichi,,One room uses four times more than the lightest. It’s the heater and desktop.,"{""words"":14,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
39,2,1,talk,Misaki,,People are sweating it out rather than argue. The cooler notice stayed up all summer.,"{""words"":15,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
40,2,2,talk,Mio,,"@Ryuji, that swing is huge. How do we handle that?","{""words"":10,""mentions"":[""Ryuji""],""raw_differs"":false}"
41,2,2,talk,Ryuji,,"@Mio, we need a buffer. Or a fixed rate. I don't want surprises.","{""words"":13,""mentions"":[""Mio""],""raw_differs"":false}"
42,2,2,talk,Rin,,"@Shunichi, if one room uses that much, shouldn't they pay more?","{""words"":11,""mentions"":[""Shunichi""],""raw_differs"":false}"
43,2,2,talk,Shunichi,,"@Rin, yes. But fitting meters costs 34,000 yen a room. That’s expensive.","{""words"":12,""mentions"":[""Rin""],""raw_differs"":false}"
44,2,2,talk,Misaki,,"@Rin, the template is too much work. We need something simpler.","{""words"":11,""mentions"":[""Rin""],""raw_differs"":false}"
45,2,3,talk,Mio,,I don't want to pay for heat I don't use. But I don't want to argue either.,"{""words"":17,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
46,2,3,talk,Ryuji,,The payment log shows late payments when amounts changed. People get angry.,"{""words"":12,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
47,2,3,talk,Rin,,"If we do per-room metering, the setup cost is high. But it’s fair.","{""words"":13,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
48,2,3,talk,Shunichi,,"A flat share is easy, but it ignores the usage gap. It’s unfair.","{""words"":13,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
49,2,3,talk,Misaki,,A seasonal fixed rate might work. No monthly arguments. Just one settle at year end.,"{""words"":15,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
50,2,4,talk,Mio,,I like the idea of a fixed rate. It feels stable.,"{""words"":11,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
51,2,4,talk,Ryuji,,I agree. It protects me from the winter spike.,"{""words"":9,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
52,2,4,talk,Rin,,"If it’s just one settle, I can handle it. It’s not monthly.","{""words"":12,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
53,2,4,talk,Shunichi,,"It’s a compromise. Not perfect, but workable.","{""words"":7,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
54,2,4,talk,Misaki,,It stops the monthly tension. I’m in.,"{""words"":7,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
