60,3,1,talk,Mio,,Option A is Seasonal Fixed Rate. Option B is Per-Room Metering. Option C is Flat Share.,"{""words"":16,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
61,3,1,talk,Ryuji,,I prefer A. It smooths out the volatility.,"{""words"":8,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
62,3,1,talk,Rin,,"B is fair, but the cost is high. A is simpler.","{""words"":11,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
63,3,1,talk,Shunichi,,C is too lazy. A is a good middle ground.,"{""words"":10,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
64,3,1,talk,Misaki,,A reduces the friction. I support it.,"{""words"":7,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
65,3,2,talk,Mio,,"@Ryuji, does A mean we pay a set amount every month?","{""words"":11,""mentions"":[""Ryuji""],""raw_differs"":false}"
66,3,2,talk,Ryuji,,"@Mio, yes. And we settle the difference at the end of the year.","{""words"":13,""mentions"":[""Mio""],""raw_differs"":false}"
67,3,2,talk,Rin,,That sounds manageable. I don't have to do math every month.,"{""words"":11,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
68,3,2,talk,Shunichi,,"It’s not perfect, but it’s better than the status quo.","{""words"":10,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
69,3,2,talk,Misaki,,I’m voting for A. Let’s move on.,"{""words"":7,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
70,3,3,talk,Mio,,I’m voting for A. It feels right for the house.,"{""words"":10,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
71,3,3,talk,Ryuji,,I’m voting for A. It’s the most rational choice.,"{""words"":9,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
72,3,3,talk,Rin,,I’m voting for A. It saves me time.,"{""words"":8,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
73,3,3,talk,Shunichi,,I’m voting for A. It’s a practical solution.,"{""words"":8,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
74,3,3,talk,Misaki,,I’m voting for A. It helps us get along.,"{""words"":9,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
75,3,4,talk,Mio,,Looks like we’re all on the same page.,"{""words"":8,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
76,3,4,talk,Ryuji,,Indeed. Let’s finalize it.,"{""words"":4,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
77,3,4,talk,Rin,,Yay! No more monthly drama.,"{""words"":5,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
78,3,4,talk,Shunichi,,Efficient. I’ll draft the agreement.,"{""words"":5,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
79,3,4,talk,Misaki,,Thank you all. Let’s keep it friendly.,"{""words"":7,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
